cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Functional regression modelling of soluble solids content in apple and hyperparameter selection with small calibration sets"
abstract: >-
  Code and reproducibility materials for a study comparing functional penalized
  linear regression and functional principal component regression with PLSR,
  SVR, random forest and a 1D-CNN for near-infrared prediction of soluble solids
  content in apple, under nested cross-validation with equal numbers of
  candidate configurations, with emphasis on hyperparameter selection with small
  training sets and on cross-batch recalibration.
